<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>Amex Composite index closed at 555.52, down 0.99.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 248 to 226.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,430,120 compared with 19,054,605 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
</text>
